{"id":"n58694-1-8","stage":4,"title":"변변찮다 · 不怎么样","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58694-1-8-1","ko":"오늘 소개팅에 나온 남자 어땠어?","zh":"今天约会的那个男人怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"소개팅에","meaning":"相亲","explanation":"소개팅：相亲；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"소개팅","audio":"/audio/eeb441c4ef6cc8bc32cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64308","senseId":"1","lemma":"소개팅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소개팅에","audio":"/audio/8484fe867b08c0557b00.mp3"}},{"text":"나온","meaning":"出现，出场，参加","explanation":"나오다：出现，出场，参加；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"8","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나온","audio":"/audio/a357a1f232b9a828c908.mp3"}},{"text":"남자","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"eeb441c4ef6cc8bc","term":"소개팅","zh":"相亲","audio":"/audio/eeb441c4ef6cc8bc32cf.mp3","entryId":"64308","definition":"在中间介绍男女一对一见面。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现，出场，参加","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在某处现身。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子，男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"作为男性出生的人。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f6d431747da009d2aaf0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58694-1-8-2","ko":"성격이 변변찮아서 별로였어.","zh":"他性格很差，所以不太好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"성격이","meaning":"性格","explanation":"성격：性格；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"성격","audio":"/audio/9b3edda555d03500b72a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62821","senseId":"1","lemma":"성격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성격이","audio":"/audio/31c084ee93a1687394ae.mp3"}},{"text":"변변찮아서","meaning":"不怎么样","explanation":"변변찮다：不怎么样；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"변변찮다","audio":"/audio/340481cfab875019b6a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58694","senseId":"1","lemma":"변변찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"변변찮아서","audio":"/audio/d4b3ea032d08c494c02e.mp3"}},{"text":"별로였어.","meaning":"特别，格外","explanation":"별로：特别，格外；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별로였어","audio":"/audio/2511ac93b0972bafdd14.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9b3edda555d03500","term":"성격","zh":"性格","audio":"/audio/9b3edda555d03500b72a.mp3","entryId":"62821","definition":"个人具有的固有脾气或品性。","pronunciation":["성ː껵"]},{"id":"340481cfab875019","term":"변변찮다","zh":"不怎么样","audio":"/audio/340481cfab875019b6a6.mp3","entryId":"58694","definition":"人的长相或为人等不及一般的水平。","pronunciation":["변변찬타"]},{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"特别，格外","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"特殊额外地；或指那么不同地。","pronunciation":["별로"]}],"audio":"/audio/f1a0de84a07fb492ddfc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.417,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58694","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":126,"sequenceScore":2.2437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["他性格很差，所以不太好。","今天约会的那个男人怎么样？","您昨晚睡得好吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天约会的那个男人怎么样？","您昨晚睡得好吗？","他性格很差，所以不太好。"],"answer":2}]}
